\alttext(Complete compact HRNet fits512 visible Adam updates. Unregularized weighted CE and validation mean IoU are plotted;paired learned/BN restoration precedes held-out predictions and branch inspection.)

Compact HRNet has382,580 learned and3,744 BN state scalars. Epoch19 is
selected with validation mean IoU.514050. Test pixel accuracy is.860664,
but mean IoU is.480074: background.952996,circle.241481,rectangle
.377457 and triangle.348361. The prediction gallery retains these class
confusions;high background accuracy does not imply strong shape recognition.

